  "notes": "Resolved from start.sh cmd_serve + .env.example (note start.sh's own built-in defaults differ: GPU_MEM_UTIL 0.88, MAX_MODEL_LEN 32768, MAX_NUM_SEQS 2, KV fp8_ds_mla, ENABLE_MTP 0 - the .env is required to get the recipe). Checkpoint is a hybrid: NVFP4 hot experts + AQLM 2-bit cold experts, fp8 W8A16 o_proj/shared experts (~272 GB + ~1 GB vision). Needs fork jarrelscy/vllm-glm52-sm120 (baked into image); TP3 head pad 64->66 via VLLM_GLM_TP_PAD. VLLM_HOST_IP/HOST_IP = each node's fabric IP (HEAD_IP 10.0.0.1, WORKER1_IP 10.0.0.2, WORKER2_IP 10.0.0.3 examples); NCCL_IB_GID_INDEX auto-resolved per node (fallback 3). Image tag == :latest; README cites digest prefix f8f350d4 only. Optional DSpark draft path (Sparkulator-GLM-5.2) is documented as research-only, no speed win. API also serves Anthropic /v1/messages.",
